faction-alert-code-hestia = Hestia
faction-alert-code-hestia-description = Peace. Fighting between factions is forbidden. Disputes are settled by diplomacy.
faction-alert-hestia-start = Attention all crews! The military situation in the sector is stable. Transition to code Hestia has begun. Armed formations are to stand down.
faction-alert-hestia-end = Code Hestia is in effect. Armed formations are to refrain from force and return to diplomacy.

faction-alert-code-pandora = Pandora
faction-alert-code-pandora-description = Only infantry fighting over points of interest is allowed. Ships stay out of the war.
faction-alert-pandora-start = Attention all crews! The diplomatic situation is deteriorating. Transition to code Pandora has begun. Prepare for ground operations.
faction-alert-pandora-end = Code Pandora is in effect. Local infantry clashes are now permitted. Civilians should avoid faction-held points of interest.

faction-alert-code-ares = Ares
faction-alert-code-ares-description = Full-scale war, including ships.
faction-alert-ares-start = Attention all crews! The conflict has left diplomatic control. Transition to code Ares has begun. Prepare your ships.
faction-alert-ares-end = Code Ares is in effect. Armed formations are no longer restricted outside home bases. Unidentified ships may be fired upon.

